 "notes": "Added CRT television and video monitor; kept the three old kinds. Rear-projection models kept as flat list (5). Kodak and Leica slide projectors and Elmo cine projectors became versions of archetypes; Revere model name tidied ('Revere Revere Eight' to 'Revere Eight'). Brief said Trinitron KV-1310 (1968); the Trinitron article names the KV-1210 as the original, so that is used. Left out as not attested on a fetched page: Brionvega Doney (Domus page blocked, retry redirected), Sony KV-HR, Philips CRT sets, Braun Paxiscope (Slide projector article names Paximat instead), Bell & Howell projectors, Mitsubishi model history."
